DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
"PGstandard.pl",
"MathObjects.pl",
"PGML.pl"
);
Context("Numeric");
Context()->operators->undefine('+','-','*','/');

BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

[`14+11+16+4*4`] is equal to [_____]{answer=>Real(57.),width=>6}
---

What is the value of [`15+0-1+8*15`]? [_____]{134}
---

What is the value of [`6+1-11`]? [_____]{Formula("-4")}
---

What is the value of [`14+4-17-0`]? [_____]{Real(1.)}
---

[`7+19-12-10*16`] is equal to [_____]{answer=>-146,width=>9}
---
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
